<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Product (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 18 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 15.OCT.96-24.SEP.97   PAYDATE	14.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  681.50 USD</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	   ISS PRICE	 GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  660.00 USD     7.665 USD	  8.89 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	  690.00 USD     5.539 USD	 12.30 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	  720.00 USD     3.670 USD	 18.57 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	   630.00 USD     2.317 USD	 29.41 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT E	   660.00 USD     3.062 USD	 22.26 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT F	   690.00 USD     4.077 USD	 16.72 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
